From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:41:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] of: dynamic: Add of_changeset_add_prop_u8_array()

The changeset helpers can add string, string array, u32 array and
boolean properties, but not a byte array such as the local-bd-address of
a Bluetooth controller node created at runtime.

Add of_changeset_add_prop_u8_array(), following
of_changeset_add_prop_u32_array(). Bytes need no endianness conversion,
so the property is duplicated directly from the caller's array.

Assisted-by: Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/of/dynamic.c | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/linux/of.h   |  4 ++++
 2 files changed, 33 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/of/dynamic.c b/drivers/of/dynamic.c
index 744ce0e1eb2..7b5f8c12ac8 100644
--- a/drivers/of/dynamic.c
+++ b/drivers/of/dynamic.c
@@ -1028,6 +1028,35 @@ int of_changeset_add_prop_string_array(struct of_changeset *ocs,
 }
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(of_changeset_add_prop_string_array);
 
+/**
+ * of_changeset_add_prop_u8_array - Add a property of 8 bit integers to a
+ * changeset
+ *
+ * @ocs:	changeset pointer
+ * @np:		device node pointer
+ * @prop_name:	name of the property to be added
+ * @array:	pointer to an array of 8 bit integers
+ * @sz:		number of array elements
+ *
+ * Create a property of 8 bit integers and add it to a changeset.
+ *
+ * Return: 0 on success, a negative error value in case of an error.
+ */
+int of_changeset_add_prop_u8_array(struct of_changeset *ocs,
+				   struct device_node *np,
+				   const char *prop_name,
+				   const u8 *array, size_t sz)
+{
+	struct property prop;
+
+	prop.name = (char *)prop_name;
+	prop.length = sz;
+	prop.value = (void *)array;
+
+	return of_changeset_add_prop_helper(ocs, np, &prop);
+}
+EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(of_changeset_add_prop_u8_array);
+
 /**
  * of_changeset_add_prop_u32_array - Add a property of 32 bit integers
  * property to a changeset
diff --git a/include/linux/of.h b/include/linux/of.h
index b920aac6b97..4ff90d0f9ea 100644
--- a/include/linux/of.h
+++ b/include/linux/of.h
@@ -1736,6 +1736,10 @@ int of_changeset_add_prop_string_array(struct of_changeset *ocs,
 				       struct device_node *np,
 				       const char *prop_name,
 				       const char * const *str_array, size_t sz);
+int of_changeset_add_prop_u8_array(struct of_changeset *ocs,
+				   struct device_node *np,
+				   const char *prop_name,
+				   const u8 *array, size_t sz);
 int of_changeset_add_prop_u32_array(struct of_changeset *ocs,
 				    struct device_node *np,
 				    const char *prop_name,
-- 
